WEBVTT

00:12:58.679 --> 00:13:01.033
where everyone else has 600 best friends,

00:13:01.057 --> 00:13:03.016
and you don't know anyone.

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:05.472
AG: We were all there
at some point in high school,

00:13:05.496 --> 00:13:08.710
but loneliness can be just as difficult
to deal with as we grow up,

00:13:08.734 --> 00:13:10.930
which is why it's important
to talk about it.

00:13:10.954 --> 00:13:13.493
DB: People are very reluctant
to talk about loneliness

00:13:13.517 --> 00:13:15.816
because they feel it's a personal failure.

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:20.076
I think pretty much everybody
does feel lonely at work.

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:24.043
I mean, I think the fact is
that most people don't talk about it.

00:13:24.067 --> 00:13:26.789
AG: She's been keeping track
of a few workplace practices

00:13:26.813 --> 00:13:28.677
that have brought people together, too.

00:13:28.701 --> 00:13:31.226
Workplaces that, like Vivek
with his photo-sharing,